WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
The 23rd Headquarters Special Troops created phantom forces in Europe.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Inflatable vehicles supplied a distant visual cue.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Recorded sounds and radio deception reinforced the illusion.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
The props were fake; the soldiers’ danger was real. Check how evidence was produced.
